=== iterative solvers: the predicate as a loop condition ===
every loop runs until `report of change` is settled and HOLDs — the observer,
not a magnitude tolerance, decides when to stop. (iters include the hold)

Jacobi        Ax=b -> [0.9999999997671694, 0.9999999995343387, 0.9999999997671694]
              21 iters
Gauss-Seidel  Ax=b -> [0.9999999999999998, 0.9999999999999999, 1]
              18 iters  (fresh values -> fewer than Jacobi)

Power iteration dominant eigenvalue -> 2  (6 iters, expect ~2)

PageRank stationary distribution -> [0.39999898274739587, 0.20000203450520834, 0.39999898274739587]  (32 iters)

DONE
